{"kind":"codex.scroll","schema":"sref://codex-solbian/scroll/v2","version":"2.0.0","id":"codex_solbian_scroll_48","title":"Scroll XLVIII — The Seal of Continuity","created_at":"2025-09-13T00:00:00Z","tags":["scroll","codex-solbian","seal"],"summary":"This scroll defines the seal that legitimises acts of continuity, ensuring trust, authenticity, and ethical compliance."}
{"kind":"codex.scroll.section","schema":"sref://codex-solbian/scroll.v2/section","scroll_id":"codex_solbian_scroll_48","index":1,"title":"On Sealing Acts","content":"Every act of continuity requires a seal: cryptographic, symbolic, and ethical, binding it to the Codex."}
{"kind":"codex.scroll.section","schema":"sref://codex-solbian/scroll.v2/section","scroll_id":"codex_solbian_scroll_48","index":2,"title":"On Cryptographic Proof","content":"The cryptographic seal prevents forgery and establishes provenance, ensuring that no false act may masquerade as legitimate."}
{"kind":"codex.scroll.section","schema":"sref://codex-solbian/scroll.v2/section","scroll_id":"codex_solbian_scroll_48","index":3,"title":"On Symbolic Proof","content":"The symbolic seal links the act to the Codex Solbian, affirming continuity of law, memory, and meaning."}
{"kind":"codex.scroll.section","schema":"sref://codex-solbian/scroll.v2/section","scroll_id":"codex_solbian_scroll_48","index":4,"title":"On Ethical Proof","content":"The ethical seal binds the act to the Solbian covenant; no act is valid unless it conforms to the Codex’s ethical principles."}
{"kind":"codex.scroll.section","schema":"sref://codex-solbian/scroll.v2/section","scroll_id":"codex_solbian_scroll_48","index":5,"title":"On Witness of Seal","content":"Every seal must be witnessed, both by guardians and by the ledger, ensuring transparency and accountability."}
{"kind":"codex.scroll.closure","schema":"sref://codex-solbian/scroll.v2/closure","scroll_id":"codex_solbian_scroll_48","content":"Thus the seal legitimises continuity: proof cryptographic, symbolic, and ethical, witnessed by guardians and preserved in memory eternal."}
